{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00038",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 2.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.42,
      "end_seconds": 6.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.73,
      "end_seconds": 13.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a tight band-like headache, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.14,
      "end_seconds": 16.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.15,
      "end_seconds": 20.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "It's been four weeks, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.49,
      "end_seconds": 25.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.66,
      "end_seconds": 31.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Only a head massage, and it's not much. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.6,
      "end_seconds": 34.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Has there been tired eyes too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.59,
      "end_seconds": 37.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Yes, for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.01,
      "end_seconds": 46.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.45,
      "end_seconds": 55.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.25,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, screens. That makes it worse. It's moderate, honestly. And there's irritability as well, three weeks now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.92,
      "end_seconds": 59.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.06,
      "end_seconds": 77.2,
      "duration_seconds": 16.14,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.47,
      "end_seconds": 80.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Have you had any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.04,
      "end_seconds": 83.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.06,
      "end_seconds": 88.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Have you had any numbness, jaw pain when chewing, blurred vision or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.43,
      "end_seconds": 91.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.58,
      "end_seconds": 94.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.98,
      "end_seconds": 98.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Just a C-section, about ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.45,
      "end_seconds": 104.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.74,
      "end_seconds": 108.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.41,
      "end_seconds": 111.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Alright, moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.39,
      "end_seconds": 117.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Right, I have high blood pressure, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.58,
      "end_seconds": 118.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.29,
      "end_seconds": 122.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.61,
      "end_seconds": 136.41,
      "duration_seconds": 12.8,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.65,
      "end_seconds": 139.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.64,
      "end_seconds": 142.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.98,
      "end_seconds": 143.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.27,
      "end_seconds": 147.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Okay, how's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.41,
      "end_seconds": 153.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.62,
      "end_seconds": 160.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.57,
      "end_seconds": 165.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I'm on amlodipine, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.78,
      "end_seconds": 167.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.92,
      "end_seconds": 170.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "It's 5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.66,
      "end_seconds": 174.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.78,
      "end_seconds": 186.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.39,
      "end_seconds": 203.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 98 percent on room air, pulse 78. And temp 36.6 degrees, respiratory rate 16, pressure 120 over 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.11,
      "end_seconds": 210.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.94,
      "end_seconds": 215.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.44,
      "end_seconds": 236.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "The muscles at the back of your neck are tight and tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.59,
      "end_seconds": 238.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.64,
      "end_seconds": 252.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "Alright, all done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.43,
      "end_seconds": 256.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.29,
      "end_seconds": 258.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.71,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.55,
      "end_seconds": 281.74,
      "duration_seconds": 12.19,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with a tension-type headache. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out a medication-overuse headache yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.92,
      "end_seconds": 285.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.73,
      "end_seconds": 304.57,
      "duration_seconds": 17.84,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a tension-type headache, and we'll know more once the an eye check is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a tight band-like headache for four weeks, severe, and no blurred vision or weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.96,
      "end_seconds": 307.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.71,
      "end_seconds": 322.52,
      "duration_seconds": 14.81,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.38,
      "end_seconds": 325.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.72,
      "end_seconds": 330.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an eye check for headache and eye strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 331.4,
      "end_seconds": 334.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I can book that for Friday at 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.96,
      "end_seconds": 351.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.08,
      "text": "I'll start you on amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, for six weeks. That should help with headache prevention. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Painkillers on most days can actually make the headaches stick around."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.46,
      "end_seconds": 370.91,
      "duration_seconds": 19.45,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I'll also refer you to physiotherapy. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. Please come and see me in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.35,
      "end_seconds": 373.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.49,
      "end_seconds": 381.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "So, can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.19,
      "end_seconds": 389.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "So, I take the amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.69,
      "end_seconds": 395.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.69,
      "end_seconds": 398.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.88,
      "end_seconds": 399.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}